# Hello, Zolto!

This is a basic Zolto document — a strict superset of standard Markdown with zero dependencies.

## Inline Formatting

**Bold**, *italic*, `inline code`, ==highlighted==, ~~strikethrough~~, [link](https://example.com).

## Native Callout & Math

> [!NOTE]
> Every valid `.md` file is a valid `.zl` file.

Inline math: $E = mc^2$.

## Vector & Chart Showcase

@vector width=400 height=160 theme="dark"
rect x=20 y=20 w=360 h=120 radius=16 fill="#1a1f2b" stroke="#2d3648" strokeWidth=2
circle cx=70 cy=80 r=30 fill="#7c5cff"
text x=120 y=85 size=20 fill="#ffffff"
  Zolto Vector
@endtext
@/vector

